1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:02,700
(Sheldon:)Really?

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,670
(Sheldon:)Why?

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,910
(Leonard:)Because you're impossible
to work with.

4
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,620
(Sheldon:)I see.

5
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,710
(Sheldon:)And is that open
for discussion?

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,390
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

7
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:26,360
(Sheldon:)Oh. Good morning, shoemaker.

8
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:28,590
(Sheldon:)I think you'll be pleased

9
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,560
(Sheldon:)with what the elves were up to
last night.

10
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,460
(Leonard:)But I fired you.

11
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,730
(Sheldon:)Oh, I know. I'm now
an independent contractor.

12
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:38,150
(Leonard:)No, you are
now nothing.

13
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:41,100
(Leonard:)You have no connection
to this project whatsoever.

14
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,540
(Sheldon:)But I made it better.

15
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,780
(Leonard:)I don't want it better.
I want it my way.

16
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,210
(Sheldon:)Well, that speaks volumes,
doesn't it?

17
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:53,120
(Sheldon:)All right, I suppose
I'll go put on my bus pants.

18
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:55,370
(Leonard:)What the hell are bus pants?

19
00:00:55,370 --> 00:00:57,820
(Sheldon:)They are pants one wears
over one's regular pants

20
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,320
(Sheldon:)when one sits on bus seats

21
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)that other people
have previously sat on.

